Package: verimark-driver
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fprintd
Suggests: verimark-cli, libpam-fprintd
Description: libfprint TOD driver for the Kensington VeriMark Desktop
 libfprint "touch OEM driver" module for the Kensington VeriMark Desktop
 fingerprint key (K62330WW, USB 047d:00f2), a Synaptics match-in-sensor
 device. It makes the sensor usable with fprintd, desktop login and
 pam_fprintd.
 .
 On first use the driver pairs the host with the sensor and keeps the
 pairing secret in /var/lib/fprint/verimark.

Package: verimark-cli
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: verimark-driver
Description: diagnostic tool for the Kensington VeriMark Desktop
 Talks to the Kensington VeriMark Desktop fingerprint key without fprintd:
 shows firmware and pairing information, lists and erases enrollments,
 pairs the host with the sensor and logs finger events.
 .
 It shares the pairing in /var/lib/fprint/verimark with the libfprint
 TOD driver. Stop fprintd before using it.
